  "title": "Spiedies",
  "description": "Spiedies are the pride and joy of Binghamton, New York. Tender cubes of marinated meat are grilled on skewers, then served with no condiments on bread.",
  "authors": [
    "JOYBOWES"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-10T02:59:53-04:00",
